# Razor Mavuika Fischl Kirara. ~20s Rot. Razor Quickburn with Kirara C4 providing Dendro into Razor's burst uptime while full EM Mauvika offers off-field Pyro. Mavuika bursts every rotation. Fischl alternates skill and burst just before Razor. Kirara doesn't burst at all and builds full HP.

